      (componentSeeds (GenericField K) S.G
        (globalTailCut (polynomialEmbedding K) S.F (w + 1))
        (regularitySurface (polynomialEmbedding K) S.F) Gamma
        (selectedPoint (polynomialEmbedding K) S.selected) C).card ≤
